SOP-s where this would apply:

* Not Fit for Purpose Vehicle Use
* Driver in Vehicle Accident Causing Injury or Structural Damage
* Driver in Vehicle Accident Resulting in any Cosmetic Damage

Possible solution:

{panel:bgColor=#fffae6}
*Information for Fleet Drivers*

* A fleet driver is a driver that is employed by a fleet owner and has access to multiple vehicles through the app (you can check from Admin if a driver has multiple vehicles linked to their account);
* Some countries might have both fleet and private drivers. This SOP applies only to Fleet Driver;
* Due to access to different vehicles, fleet drivers can quickly change the vehicle displayed in the app.

Ask the fleet driver if they intend to change the vehicle or if they will wait for the current one to be repaired.

* If the driver confirms that they will change vehicle, unblock them;
* If the driver confirms that they will repair the vehicle, ask them to come back to us once it has been done with proof of repair (pictures or invoice), so they can be unblocked. 
{panel}

